{
  "scope": "Phase 5 frozen structural case universe for source-reviewed keys that have no machine-readable cases.json. Python rows are read from docs/samples/<app>/cases.json and vuln-nextjs rows from the lab's tests/expected-scanner-findings.json at the pin; neither is copied here. Rows restate the cited key; expectations never enter scanner or model input.",
  "expectations": {
    "positive": "Candidate of the kind at the anchor with a witnessed source (source anchor when given) and no completeness blockers; expect_status names the presented status a positive must reach (a practice finding does not satisfy confirmed)",
